<div class="container py-5">
  <div class="col-lg-7">
    <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold mb-4">About</h1>
    <p class="fs-5">
      Alpha Blog is a small place for short articles: a title, a few lines, and that's it.
      Anyone can read what is here, write a new article, or edit and delete one.
    </p>
    <p class="fs-5 text-body-secondary">
      It started as a practice project to learn Ruby on Rails, and it keeps growing as I add features.
      It's built with Ruby on Rails and Bootstrap.
    </p>
    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-4">
      <%= link_to "Read articles", articles_path, class: "btn btn-dark" %>
      <%= link_to "Write an article", new_article_path, class: "btn btn-outline-dark" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
